      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i think i misunderstood something about the supplier info. in my products table, i have supplier_id and supplier_address. since the address depends on the supplier, not the product_id, wouldn't that be a transitive dependency too? how do i move that out correctly without breaking the link to the products?",
      "source": "evaluator"
